### 7. Right to be forgotten
DELETE http://localhost:8000/users/user-123/memory

# --> 200
# { "user_id": "user-123", "removed": 3 }

### 8. Liveness + which brain backend is actually live
GET http://localhost:8000/health

# --> 200
# { "status": "ok", "brain": { "backend": "InMemoryBrainStore", "healthy": true } }

### 9. Invalid input is the ONLY 4xx — everything else degrades to a 200
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "session_id": "session-456",
  "message": ""
}

# --> 422 Unprocessable Entity
# { "detail": [ { "type": "string_too_short", "loc": ["body", "message"], ... } ] }
